# A table of square roots, six to a line: one PRINT of twelve values types two
# lines with no line space between them (E-364 p. 6-7). F¹ is the square root.
    a = F^1(1), b = F^1(2), c = F^1(3), d = F^1(4), e = F^1(5), f = F^1(6),
    g = F^1(7), h = F^1(8), i = F^1(9), j = F^1(10), k = F^1(11), l = F^1(12),
    PRINT a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h, i, j, k, l.
    STOP
